   <text:h text:style-name="P5" text:outline-level="2">MOSFETs</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:tab/><text:span text:style-name="T16">Recall that a capacitor is a two plate device, where, when a voltage difference is applied across it, a charge buildup is formed in between the two plates (</text:span><draw:frame text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.1138in" draw:z-index="13" draw:style-name="gr3" draw:text-style-name="P13" svg:width="0.5996in" svg:height="0.1469in">
